Description: MainWindow: include RecentItems from V\OS's path (temporary)
 Temporary patch: upstream's bare #include <RecentItems.h> is correct, but
 V\OS does not make it resolve. Verified in this container: the header
 exists only at /system/develop/headers/os/be_apps/Tracker/RecentItems.h,
 /etc/vos.specs lists no -I for that directory (it does list -I for
 headers/os and for private/shared), and private/shared carries no copy of
 the file. VOS-BUGS: headers/os/be_apps/Tracker/RecentItems.h is not
 reachable as <RecentItems.h> -- one-line fix: also install a forwarding
 header at headers/private/shared/RecentItems.h, or add
 -I/system/develop/headers/os/be_apps/Tracker to /etc/vos.specs. Drop this
 patch when either lands.
Author: Numerio <b.vitruvio@gmail.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
Origin: vendor
Last-Update: 2026-10-23
This patch header follows DEP-3: http://dep.debian.net/deps/dep3/

--- a/MainWindow.cpp
+++ b/MainWindow.cpp
@@ -17,6 +17,6 @@
 #include <NodeInfo.h>
 #include <Path.h>
-#include <RecentItems.h>
+#include <os/be_apps/Tracker/RecentItems.h>
 #include <Resources.h>
 #include <Screen.h>
 #include <ScrollView.h>
